#: ../../source/guide/gui.md ff75320ee32c410189de0699edac9913
msgid "对话式发起计算（见下文 AI 助手）"
msgstr "Drive computations conversationally (see AI Assistant below)"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:14 990d7c13961d453c898ddbc49930a62c
msgid "左栏右上角的下拉在中 / EN 之间切换界面语言，选择持久化（localStorage）， 重启后保留。"
msgstr ""
"The dropdown at the top of the left column switches the interface "
"language between Chinese and English; the choice persists (localStorage) "
"across restarts."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:17 457ba87e3bb743a098196d3a803e725c
msgid "左栏：项目与轨道库"
msgstr "Left Column: Project and Catalog"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:19 e343a4c5e10d4483b47912575dbd0009
msgid "**项目页签**列出当前会话生成的产物（族生成完成后自动出现）。"
msgstr ""
"The **Project tab** lists products generated in the current session (a "
"family appears automatically once generation completes)."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:21 81dd8b706834447cb6a1d19d80944667
msgid ""
"**轨道库页签**打开即查询全库（空过滤条件），结果显示在下方项目树；过滤栏复用 参数面板的自动表单机制，支持按族类型、平动点、Jacobi "
"区间、振幅区间与标签 组合筛选，改完点查询。"
msgstr ""
"The **Catalog tab** queries the whole library on open (empty filter); "
"results show in the project tree below. The filter bar reuses the "
"parameter panel's auto-form mechanism and supports combined filtering by "
"family type, libration point, Jacobi range, amplitude range and tags - "
"adjust and click \"Query\"."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:25 14e890b1de984df3a3e36c0c94ac6558
msgid ""
"点击树中任一记录，画布把该轨迹钉入**固定层**，与结果层同屏对照；按住 Ctrl 多选可同屏叠加多条（固定层软上限 5 "
"条，超出提示但不拦截）。记录可 写备注、加星标（ADR 0024），在记录详情面板编辑；右键菜单提供删除， 过滤栏提供教学案例包导出。"
msgstr "Clicking a record pins its trajectories into the **pinned layer** for side-by-side comparison with the result layer; hold Ctrl to multi-select and overlay several records (the pinned layer is soft-capped at 5 with a hint, not blocked). Records can carry notes and stars (ADR 0024), edited in the record detail panel; deletion lives in the right-click menu, and teaching-case package export in the filter bar."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:30 6ab6afac58cb4f4abca61e089f8e8b9f
msgid "中栏：参数面板"
msgstr "Middle Column: Parameter Panel"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:32 cbace3c1d20745a98bca225f4b5c0198
msgid ""
"面板由工具的 JSON Schema 自动生成：构建期 `tools/export_tool_schemas.py` 从 e2m2e 的 "
"Pydantic 模型导出 schema 到 `frontend/src/toolSchemas/`，前端按 schema "
"渲染字段：数值框、下拉、勾选（对应模型的 Optional 语义：勾选即传值， 不勾不传）。按 `orbit_type` "
"只显示当前族适用的字段，跨族字段不出现在表单里。"
msgstr ""
"The panel is generated from the tool's JSON Schema: at build time "
"`tools/export_tool_schemas.py` exports schemas from e2m2e's Pydantic "
"models into `frontend/src/toolSchemas/`, and the frontend renders fields "
"from the schema - number boxes, dropdowns, checkboxes (mapping the "
"models' Optional semantics: checked means the value is sent, unchecked "
"means unset). Only fields applicable to the current `orbit_type` are "
"shown; cross-family fields never appear in the form."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:37 b1f7e4a3853847ab86c1d45c752c8a2d
msgid ""
"点执行前做防呆校验：必填缺失、数值越界（含独占边界）会被拦下， message 一次列出全部问题，对应字段在表单内联标红；修改参数即清 "
"标红。执行按钮不会因校验失败被禁用——防呆靠反馈，不靠隐藏。"
msgstr "Before a run, a preflight check intercepts missing required fields and out-of-range values (inclusive of exclusive bounds); the message lists all problems at once and the offending fields are flagged inline in red. Editing a parameter clears the flags. The Run button is never disabled by validation — foolproofing works by feedback, not by hiding."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:41 4aec37d16d5242aba8ee962ac163e855
msgid "运行期间执行按钮变为进度态；按钮下方状态行滚动显示 sidecar 进度 消息。"
msgstr "While a computation runs, the Run button switches to a progress state; the status line below it scrolls sidecar progress messages."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:44 c04a103e21634b41bd36078b5cf13c7f
msgid "画布区"
msgstr "Canvas Area"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:46 feaba03d923d465593149a1a12d01e20
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"详见 {doc}`visualization`。画布上方一条停靠工具栏，左侧两组单选： **投影**（3D / XY / XZ / "
"YZ）与**中心**（质心 / 地心 / 月心 / L1 / L2）；右侧操作组：**适配**（按轨迹包围盒复位视角）、**导出动画** （录制 "
"8 秒自转 webm）、**图表设置**（详见下文设置弹窗）。画布下方 时间轴显示当前时刻（T + N 天），可拖动或播放，驱动画布上的时刻 "
"标记沿轨迹走查，机动事件以 chip 标注、点击跳转（详见 {doc}`visualization`）。左下角状态行显示运行 "
"进度与当前画布内容统计（族成员数 / 库轨迹数）。"
msgstr "See {doc}`visualization` for details. A toolbar is docked above the canvas: on the left, two radio groups — **Projection** (3D / XY / XZ / YZ) and **Center** (barycentre / Earth / Moon / L1 / L2); on the right, the action group — **Fit** (reset the camera on the trajectory bounding box), **Export Animation** (record an 8-second auto-rotation webm) and **Chart Settings** (see the settings dialog below). The timeline under the canvas shows the current moment (T + N days); drag or play it to scrub the canvas time marker along trajectories, with maneuver events shown as clickable chips (see {doc}`visualization`). The status line at the bottom left shows run progress and canvas content statistics (family members / catalog trajectories)."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:55 38a425608a12464ab1c3aea24eca16de
msgid "AI 助手"
msgstr "AI Assistant"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:57 8dae13e8425047d990470767f281f0ba
msgid ""
"右侧助手边栏是内嵌的对话式 agent（ADR 0022/0023）：用户以自然语言描述 目标，助手组装工具参数、经确认后调用 e2m2e "
"工具，再用自然语言解读结果。 助手触发的产物与手动运行同语义——同一轨道库、谱系与画布叠加。"
msgstr "The assistant sidebar on the right is an embedded conversational agent (ADRs 0022/0023): describe a goal in natural language, and the assistant assembles tool parameters, calls e2m2e tools after confirmation, and interprets the results in natural language. Products triggered by the assistant follow the same semantics as manual runs — the same orbit library, lineage and canvas overlay."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:61 56ebe677c0dd46d6a4482db7513130ac
msgid ""
"**配置（BYOK）**：设置弹窗的「AI 助手」分区填入 OpenAI 兼容协议的 base URL、模型名与 API key（云端 "
"DeepSeek/通义/Kimi 或本地 Ollama/LM Studio，一套协议覆盖）；key 只存系统凭据管理器，不进界面 JS "
"上下文。未配置时边栏显示引导。"
msgstr "**Configuration (BYOK)**: fill in an OpenAI-compatible base URL, model name and API key in the \"AI Assistant\" section of the settings dialog (cloud DeepSeek/Qwen/Kimi or local Ollama/LM Studio — one protocol covers both); the key lives only in the OS credential manager, never in the webview JS context. When unconfigured, the sidebar shows a setup guide."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:66 105df818b7534a3f92fa887c73f3760c
msgid ""
"**分级确认**：只读查询（轨道库查询、记录详情）免确认直接执行；计算与 "
"改库工具先在对话流中出**工具卡片**，显示工具名与参数摘要，用户可确认、 编辑参数后确认或拒绝。完成后卡片折叠为单行摘要（工具名、状态、产物 "
"记录 id），点击展开参数与结果摘要，并可跳转「查看产物」入项目树上画布。"
msgstr "**Tiered confirmation**: read-only queries (catalog queries, record details) run directly without confirmation; computing and mutating tools first show a **tool card** in the chat stream with the tool name and a parameter summary, which the user can confirm, edit-then-confirm or reject. Afterwards the card collapses into a one-line summary (tool name, status, product record id); click to expand parameters and result summaries, or jump to \"View product\" to land it in the project tree and on the canvas."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:71 24fc5e5ee2ee4f75aed4a21d4cd77743
msgid ""
"**会话与思考等级**：会话跨重启持久化，头部会话切换器按最近活动倒序列出 历史会话，支持新建、重命名、删除与打开旧会话续聊；输入区旁可切换思考 "
"等级（关/标准/深度三档，按会话设置）。回复以 markdown 流式呈现，模型的 思考过程为消息内可折叠区块。"
msgstr "**Sessions and thinking level**: sessions persist across restarts; the session switcher at the top lists history by most recent activity and supports creating, renaming, deleting, and reopening old sessions to continue. The thinking level (off / standard / deep, three tiers) is set per session next to the input area. Replies stream as markdown, and the model's thinking process appears as a collapsible block inside the message."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:76 132414da1cb44416a025f4f7a4d14328
msgid "已知限制（上游 e2m2e 后续跟进）：AI 触发的长计算不显示真实进度（不定态 指示），且确认开始后不可取消。"
msgstr "Known limitations (to be addressed upstream in e2m2e): long computations triggered by the AI show no real progress (an indeterminate indicator only), and once confirmed they cannot be cancelled."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:79 12f75ddefc76457fa25e20f2f56a2d5a
msgid "设置弹窗"
msgstr "Settings Dialog"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:81 a85894d20ac7448badb1e596d5a6092e
msgid "图表工具栏的设置按钮打开设置弹窗，包含三块内容："
msgstr "The settings button in the canvas toolbar opens the settings dialog with three sections:"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:83 1da9fcf62a7a452b97cd04884ecfc5da
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**图表设置**：轨道线宽、颜色循环、天体与平动点标注、背景色、网格量程 等，即时生效并持久化（详见 {doc}`visualization` "
"的图表设置一节）；"
msgstr "**Chart settings**: orbit line width, color cycle, body and libration-point markers, background color, grid range, etc. — applied instantly and persisted (see the chart-settings section of {doc}`visualization`);"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:85 b39eb31f364a4bd8bd011d965becfb86
msgid "**星历内核状态**：显示 SPICE 内核就绪状态（随安装分发，自动配置）；"
msgstr "**Ephemeris kernels**: shows SPICE kernel readiness (shipped with the install, auto-configured);"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:86 3a320f58ad05482c98dbf76b637fa9f2
msgid "**AI 助手**：模型服务配置（见上节）。"
msgstr "**AI Assistant**: model service configuration (see above)."

